# Evaluation corpus, historical evidence, and the evaluation harness were
# extracted to the private getyak/capir-evals repository (GET-134). New run
# outputs are written by the private executor to its ignored runs/ directory;
# product-side evaluator output defaults to the ignored output/evaluation.

# XcodeGen can accidentally emit a project inside the checked-in project
# bundle when invoked with that bundle as its output directory.
apps/macos/TalentSignalMac.xcodeproj/TalentSignalMac.xcodeproj/
